{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/extras/f9cc95c53db8814d3ad5fed4db6d8429.poster.avif?t=1771877639\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/extras/f9cc95c53db8814d3ad5fed4db6d8429.webm?t=1771877639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/extras/f9cc95c53db8814d3ad5fed4db6d8429.mp4?t=1771877639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is corrupted and it need your clan's help! You set off with a caravan full of cats to find purifier trees to make nature livable again. Gather resources, set up a base, defenses, give your cats work to do! Manage your base, expand, make it a nice place for your fellow cats and other creatures that might visit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/extras/86aebca836244e9d7940f6a6572dfd9c.poster.avif?t=1771877639\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/extras/86aebca836244e9d7940f6a6572dfd9c.webm?t=1771877639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/extras/86aebca836244e9d7940f6a6572dfd9c.mp4?t=1771877639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOUR BASE, YOUR DESIGN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is completely up to you design your base to your liking in our little 2D base builder game.Set up your defenses, stations, farming areas however you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/extras/8a6e4aabaa5dc965b9c0381aa801ec19.poster.avif?t=1771877639\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/extras/8a6e4aabaa5dc965b9c0381aa801ec19.webm?t=1771877639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/extras/8a6e4aabaa5dc965b9c0381aa801ec19.mp4?t=1771877639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MONSTERS ARE COMING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The corrupted animals attack your base every night. Defend your base, and prepare for a counterattack to save them!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976160?t=1771877639","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/da8d94040e98de8fc388abcf8f7f29414fcd663f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771877639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/75c3ec86dd563c35093ce46f32b23bedaca667ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771877639","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/75c3ec86dd563c35093ce46f32b23bedaca667ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771877639","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/extras/f9cc95c53db8814d3ad5fed4db6d8429.poster.avif?t=1771877639\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976160/extras/f9cc95c53db8814d3ad5fed4db6